WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:02.603
Choose Violation Items to open the language picker.

2
00:00:02.603 --> 00:00:13.049
Search by ordinary words or an ordinance, then select the entry.

3
00:00:13.049 --> 00:00:15.453
Choose Done adding to return to the document.

4
00:00:15.453 --> 00:00:24.090
Click a fill-in bubble and type the detail. It goes straight into the sentence.
